Portions retained largely unchanged from the upstream project:
  - the pre-install installer-slimming engine
    (src/RadeonSoftwareSlimmer/Models/PreInstall/*)
  - the post-install engine: system services, scheduled tasks, host
    processes, installed-programs and temp-file handling
    (src/RadeonSoftwareSlimmer/Models/PostInstall/*)
  - the registry abstraction and process/7-Zip helpers
    (src/RadeonSoftwareSlimmer/Intefaces/*, src/RadeonSoftwareSlimmer/Services/
     WindowsRegistry*.cs, ProcessHandler.cs)
  - the bundled 7-Zip binaries (src/Shared/7-Zip)

New in this fork (not from upstream):
  - the left-rail shell and Fluent dark theme
  - Windows-tweaks, startup-and-services, driver-download and
    recommended-settings features and their catalogs
  - the backup / restore-point / revert mechanism

